  "name": "Forge",
  "description": "The gildrb.com and eukhe.com palette: an umber ink fired by bronze, sand and ivory, each hue climbing with its light from ember toward gilt. No blue, no purple, no pink: green (moss) and teal (verdigris) appear only where code needs hue separation (strings, functions), copper only in the ANSI magenta slot and the macOS host tag. Lc on ink: text 82, headings 96, punctuation 70, syntax and status 62, comments 52, line numbers 40, borders 23. Nothing paints the background.",
